# Ctrl+X cuts the selected word and Ctrl+V pastes it into the next task.
file <<END
- milk eggs bread
- jam
END
see milk eggs bread
keys <Enter> <Home> <S-Right> <S-Right> <S-Right> <S-Right> <S-Right> <C-x> <Down> <End> <Space> <C-v> <Esc>
see - jam milk
quit
saved <<END
- eggs bread
- jam milk 
END
